    # game/scripts/styles/screen_status.rpy:3519
    old "When it's Night and you are in a girl's room (or she's in yours), a sleepover can happen if your relationship is close enough. She stays the night, and you can interact before sleeping.\n\nMultiple girls can sleep over if they are compatible. Jealousy, traits, and how the girls feel about each other all factor in."
